ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="usage-and-paid-usage-alerts-by-text-and-the-banner" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Alerts by text and the banner</h2><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol" start="7"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">7</span><div class="gd-t">When a figure reaches 80% of its allowance, and again at 100% (the website&#39;s CPU time also at 70%), every Admin with a verified phone gets a text, once per figure and level a month, outside the quiet hours. Turn it off in Program settings (Usage alerts: also text every Admin).</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">8</span><div class="gd-t">The banner at the top of <b class="gd-ui">Today</b> speaks in money. The website, requests, storage and texts are billed by use and never paused: their banner is red only when this month&#39;s projected cost above the allowance reaches US$5 (Program settings, Usage: red banner and alert only from), and then you also get the text. Under it, one quiet grey line with the cost (usually cents) and no text. Workers AI, photos and Claude (they stop or pause) and the emails (held at 100 a day) keep their banner: red when used up, amber before.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="usage-and-paid-usage-emails-through-cloudflare-first" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Emails through Cloudflare first</h2><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol" start="9"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">9</span><div class="gd-t">The site&#39;s emails go through Cloudflare Email Service first (3,000 a month included with Workers Paid), then Resend. Sign-in emails stay on Resend. All emails together go out at most 300 a day (<b class="gd-ui">Program settings</b>, Emails a day: never more than Cloudflare&#39;s 200 and Resend&#39;s 100 together, and Resend&#39;s 100 alone until Cloudflare has sent one), and at most the day&#39;s even pace plus 30 an hour, even when many were held: customers first, then owners, hiring, staff and mar